<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Bansud Q3 net $11.0 mln vs $10.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Bansud Q3 net $11.0 mln vs $10.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to march 31.</p>
<p>Net $11.0 million vs $10.1 million.</p>
<p>EPS $0.25 vs $0.23.</p>
<p>NOTE: Bansud said at March 31 its net worth stood at $412 million.</p>
<p>Banco Nacional de Mexico SA (Banamex) has a 57 percent controlling stake in Bansud.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
